abstract: >-
  A small harness and data set for measuring which behaviors specified in an
  agent's identity document (SOUL) and memory file (MEMORY) carry over when the
  underlying language model is replaced, with same-model controls, document
  controls, and two preregistered replications. Code is MIT; paper, documents,
  and data are CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DOCS).
